# Old
dir:/var/audit/
flags:lo,aa,ad,ex,pc,fc,fd,+fm,-fr,-fw,nt
minfree:5
naflags:lo,aa
policy:cnt,argv,arge
filesz:10M
expire-after:60d OR 5G

# New
dir:/var/audit/
flags:lo,aa,ad,ex,pc,fc,fd,+fm,-fr,-fw,nt
minfree:5
naflags:lo,aa
policy:cnt,argv,arge
filesz:10M
expire-after:60d OR 10G

## What Changed & Why:
- ex captures successful executions
- pc process lifecycle visibility
- fc file creation events
- fd file deletion events
- fm all permission changes
- nt network connection visibility
- policy:arge captures environment variables
- filesz:10M bumps file size before rotation
